WEBVTT

00:06:26.712 --> 00:06:31.141
nutritious and hardy staple
with deep cultural roots.

00:06:31.626 --> 00:06:33.324
This is Mane,

00:06:33.348 --> 00:06:37.029
one of the grand grandmothers
of the Ndos village,

00:06:37.053 --> 00:06:39.942
a tornado of vigor and energy.

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:42.252
And she applauded to our invitation

00:06:42.276 --> 00:06:45.466
to portray her in her personal
favorite crop,

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:47.799
with which she works every day.

00:06:49.769 --> 00:06:52.969
KH: It's important
that participation is voluntary.

00:06:53.523 --> 00:06:55.831
(Laughter)

00:06:55.855 --> 00:06:57.776
If you have doubts in the beginning,

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.602
you will definitely regret it

00:06:59.626 --> 00:07:03.577
by the time Riitta is stuffing
cold, wet bull kelp up your nose.